        "created_at": "2018-02-15T04:30:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So being Valentine's Day I gotta ask about an ad I saw. So on Facebook I saw the ad for the RPG starter kit, which you should buy, but it seemed to imply Bunker and Wraith were a thing. So while it was a joke it had me thinking about that it would be an interesting couple. The two non powered teammates amongst what are essentially gods by comparison.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So Wraith X Bunker, you guys think it has legs or doomed to be the phantoms of what could be but never was?</p>",
